# {{projectName}}

Built with Astro Islands Architecture.

## Stack
- **Framework:** Astro (static HTML + interactive islands)
- **Island UI:** Svelte 5
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}

## Islands Architecture
This project follows the **Islands Architecture** pattern:
- Most of the page is **static HTML** (zero JavaScript shipped)
- Interactive components are **islands** — they hydrate independently
- Each island uses `client:load` / `client:idle` / `client:visible` directives

### Interactive Islands
{{#each modules}}
- **{{pascalCase this}}** — `src/islands/{{pascalCase this}}.svelte`
{{/each}}

## Commands
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server
npm run build    # Build static site
npm run preview  # Preview production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```

## Project Structure
```
src/
  islands/        # Interactive islands (Svelte components)
    {{#each modules}}
    {{pascalCase this}}.svelte  # {{pascalCase this}} island
    {{/each}}
  layouts/        # Astro page layouts
    BaseLayout.astro
  pages/          # Astro pages (static + islands)
    index.astro   # Home page with island grid
    {{#each modules}}
    {{this}}.astro # {{pascalCase this}} page
    {{/each}}
  components/     # Static Astro components
  content/        # Content collections
  styles/         # Global CSS
```
